 203	
 204		// ReviewMigrationDismissed records that the user declined the one-shot
 205		// migration of review keys from project settings to clone-local prefs.
 206		// Once true, `entire review` stops prompting on every invocation; the
 207		// user can re-enable by editing this file or deleting the key.
 208		ReviewMigrationDismissed bool `json:"review_migration_dismissed,omitempty"`
